==== InsertAmmoStopSound ====
Parameter for weapons. The parameter specifies the sound that will be played at the end of reloading.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
InsertAmmoStopSound = DoubleBarrelShotgunInsertAmmoStop,
</syntaxhighlight>

